    "detailed_description": "Embark on an immersive journey through diverse, stunning landscapes, each with its own unique atmosphere and secrets to uncover. Every realm offers a new adventure. Realm Drifter invites you to lose yourself in its beautifully detailed hand-crafted worlds, where every step reveals something extraordinary in this retro 2000s graphical walking sim.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat to expect?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Driven by a non-linear gameplay<br />\r\n- A handcrafted and detailed world featuring different &amp; unique atmospheres and environments<br />\r\n- Small, Medium &amp; Large open world levels<br />\r\n- Original OST<br />\r\n- Future additions of new realms to explore<br />\r\n- Floating foliage that we missed<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is intended to be a relaxing game, with chill calm music to accompany the player as they indulge in a magical world(s) and escape from life for a bit.",
    "about_the_game": "Embark on an immersive journey through diverse, stunning landscapes, each with its own unique atmosphere and secrets to uncover. Every realm offers a new adventure. Realm Drifter invites you to lose yourself in its beautifully detailed hand-crafted worlds, where every step reveals something extraordinary in this retro 2000s graphical walking sim.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat to expect?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Driven by a non-linear gameplay<br />\r\n- A handcrafted and detailed world featuring different &amp; unique atmospheres and environments<br />\r\n- Small, Medium &amp; Large open world levels<br />\r\n- Original OST<br />\r\n- Future additions of new realms to explore<br />\r\n- Floating foliage that we missed<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is intended to be a relaxing game, with chill calm music to accompany the player as they indulge in a magical world(s) and escape from life for a bit.",
    "short_description": "In this relaxing first-person walking sim, Realm Drifter invites you to lose yourself in these beautifully detailed hand-crafted worlds. With an original made soundtrack to accompany you and a nostalgic 2000's graphical style, indulge in these magical worlds.",
